[{"title":"穆伯通谪官合阳居常郁郁忽见近报必有贤守善待故以诗贺之","author":"吕陶","text":"浪如奔马叶舟轻，畏景炎炎尽室行。\n自处虽无迁客恨，相逢谁有故人情。\n年来江上叹头白，日近樽前觉眼明。\n浣濯尘埃好吟啸，春风旦暮入巴城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43599,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送穆伯通归成都二首 其一","author":"吕陶","text":"宦游无著任东西，通塞惟将物理齐。\n平日风波方舣棹，经年桃李又成蹊。\n尘埃易没千金剑，霄汉谁为数尺梯。\n三驿锦江归去近，知君不厌子规啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43600,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送穆伯通归成都二首 其二","author":"吕陶","text":"欲赋长谣赠别君，不胜离绪懒条陈。\n读书有感旧循吏，对酒无悰少故人。\n事往何须嗟蹭蹬，时来应是起沈沦。\n石城山下西南望，更约瓜期在早春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43601,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和静之登乐俗亭","author":"吕陶","text":"亭下寒流碧似天，亭边疏柳尚婵娟。\n山林隐隐岷峰出，江路超超楚峡连。\n对景宛然开画幅，放怀宜此醉金船。\n嗟予望极终留恨，千里浓云与淡烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43602,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"子进舍人北归过衡阳累曰会话粗释暌间之念复辱佳章存慰衰朽辄次韵以谢","author":"吕陶","text":"昔年词掖与君逢，今日天涯白发翁。\n赖有江山供晚景，未先蒲柳困西风。\n归心已适三川外，高论仍陪一笑中。\n深幸未寒交道在，非徒清句及衰穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43603,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道州何道士相会于途次匆匆告归余亦北还作诗致远别之意","author":"吕陶","text":"九疑山色望中青，似与湘江展翠屏。\n终日掩关澄俗虑，有时开卷读仙经。\n谈端往往该穷达，酒兴悠悠混醉醒。\n南去北归皆惜别，更嗟衰鬓尚飘萍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43604,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王定国北归过衡阳惠示四诗其聚散忧乐之兴尽矣率赓二篇可资笑噱 其一","author":"吕陶","text":"腊寒尝醉蒲桃酒，春霁空摇舴艋船。\n倦客偶来皆失路，故人相值似逢仙。\n半生感事惊残梦，两世知音话宿缘。\n闻说三槐长秀茂，子孙才业信家传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43605,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王定国北归过衡阳惠示四诗其聚散忧乐之兴尽矣率赓二篇可资笑噱 其二","author":"吕陶","text":"壮年驰走太行车，晚岁还家幸有馀。\n进取厚颜嗟鹤发，退藏深计得蜗庐。\n五湖谪去谁收骨，千骑归来尚载旟。\n回首太平堪颂咏，圣君勤政式商闾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43606,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过合江望安乐观","author":"吕陶","text":"四十年前曾作诗，为题山观有高碑。\n宦游奔走过此地，情思光阴非昔时。\n北望数峰殊隐隐，南飞一舸尚迟迟。\n仙家跬步未能到，深愧劳生笼与池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43607,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答季镇","author":"吕陶","text":"老向家山领一麾，安閒惟有故人知。\n尘埃是幻劳湔洗，水月如流任转移。\n可笑书空徒咄咄，愿同舍哺亦熙熙。\n春来景物虽佳丽，多谢东风少赋诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43608,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴师益三首 其一","author":"吕陶","text":"从宦故为涉险涂，强教人事与心符。\n狂言喋喋真无补，虚誉纷纷更不虞。\n世味已如流水薄，野情常逐片云孤。\n圣恩宽裕归来好，免得乡人笑懦夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43609,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴师益三首 其二","author":"吕陶","text":"谪官谁更恨蹉跎，回视浮云亦几何。\n虽向士林为覆辙，却于言路得馀波。\n当年志气消磨少，晚岁光阴赋咏多。\n每阅尘编无愧赧，此生应不负丘轲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43610,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴师益三首 其三","author":"吕陶","text":"珍重良交苦爱忘，记存愚陋枉诗章。\n华林才日敷春藻，蔀屋今朝得夜光。\n宝鉴未逢犹献璞，俊锋终在不摧刚。\n淹翔日久雄飞近，早岁才名振玉堂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43611,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昨日汉公承议见召与二三老友谈笑退而为诗少谢勤意","author":"吕陶","text":"六十年前里巷游，北归重此接朋俦。\n据鞍矍铄誇朱绂，把酒慇勤劝白头。\n况是三春同对景，何妨一笑自忘忧。\n閒中岁月非难遣，须仗新诗共唱酬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43612,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽吴太君词","author":"吕陶","text":"宝络疏封得令名，人间庆事属平生。\n身居寿域几三世，福及儿曹已九卿。\n埋石有文深纪美，吊丧多客亦哀荣。\n泉涂一往应无憾，十八年前吉冢成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43613,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答陈彝仲","author":"吕陶","text":"天质疏慵一野夫，因从利禄走官途。\n惟知名爵有常履，非向尘埃言自殊。\n万事放怀归失马，百年过晷任踆乌。\n雪霜毛发来还近，霄汉岐程去已迂。\n凡骨易沉羞许卫，短材难斲累班输。\n每甘流落为迁客，岂免挪揄笑癖儒。\n处落未能医拙病，揲蓍安敢卜亨衢。\n宜将大梦消荣辱，肯把虚名计有无。\n顾我拙艰当晚涖，惜君留滞却长吁。\n玉工早夜荣圭壁，莫使球琳委路隅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43614,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻蛩和长句","author":"吕陶","text":"唧唧微吟透绮疏，乍令人意少欢娱。\n留连夜景萧条甚，引惹秋声迤逦殊。\n似向蜗庐频学啸，恐随蛙鼓亦吹竽。\n能鸣岂羡蚣蝑股，不语堪嗤蛱蝶须。\n赋就情诗感长信，惊回仙梦失苍梧。\n虽知物性何喧寂，应念年华却叹吁。\n从此渐为寒月计，凭谁与画小轩图。\n西堂忽起东归兴，望断青嵩接绿芜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43615,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题洋川与可学士公园十七首 其一 湖桥","author":"吕陶","text":"湖中少尘氛，事外得野趣。\n日日过桥来，迟留不能去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43616,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题洋川与可学士公园十七首 其二 横湖","author":"吕陶","text":"极望渺无际，悠然澄碧波。\n清风与明月，此处得之多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43617,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题洋川与可学士公园十七首 其三 荻浦","author":"吕陶","text":"叶底留残雨，丛边泊小舟。\n夜声才索索，应是报新秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43618,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题洋川与可学士公园十七首 其四 蓼屿","author":"吕陶","text":"水际柔枝倒，霜前晚穗红。\n野禽来泊此，浑是画图中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43619,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题洋川与可学士公园十七首 其五 涵虚亭","author":"吕陶","text":"亭如主人心，中虚见诸外。\n回环四顾间，殊无一毫碍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43620,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题洋川与可学士公园十七首 其六 灙泉亭","author":"吕陶","text":"灙泉涓涓流，可鉴毛发影。\n渊源既澄清，到处是佳景。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43621,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题洋川与可学士公园十七首 其七 露香亭","author":"吕陶","text":"春早花方绽，朝寒露未晞。\n可怜蜂与蝶，已去逐芳菲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43622,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题洋川与可学士公园十七首 其八 溪光亭","author":"吕陶","text":"风来绿衣摇，雨罢青烟罩。\n隐隐夕阳间，渔人理归棹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43623,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题洋川与可学士公园十七首 其九 过溪亭","author":"吕陶","text":"野亭傍幽溪，从此过溪去。\n平日已忘机，沙鸥何必惧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43624,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题洋川与可学士公园十七首 其十 禊亭","author":"吕陶","text":"山阴已陈迹，此乐终如何。\n酒船深不碍，去住少风波。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43625,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题洋川与可学士公园十七首 其十一 菡萏轩","author":"吕陶","text":"开轩向芙蓉，红绿如捧拥。\n游鱼定相忘，时见花光动。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43626,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题洋川与可学士公园十七首 其十二 书轩","author":"吕陶","text":"隐几坐幽轩，幽怀日疆慱。\n黄卷有圣贤，几人知此乐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43627,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题洋川与可学士公园十七首 其十三 荼蘼洞","author":"吕陶","text":"琼瑰露华英，绿幄相芘覆。\n几度得风清，真香到襟袖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43628,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题洋川与可学士公园十七首 其十四 筼筜谷","author":"吕陶","text":"汉川如渭川，千亩尽修竹。\n疑此是芝田，年年生碧玉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43629,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题洋川与可学士公园十七首 其十五 寒芦港","author":"吕陶","text":"悠悠江湖思，扰扰声名累。\n溪上见芦花，宁无慊然意。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43630,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题洋川与可学士公园十七首 其十六 野人庐","author":"吕陶","text":"耕锄事勤苦，赋敛少驱逼。\n终日掩柴荆，何尝知帝力。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43631,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题洋川与可学士公园十七首 其十七 金橙径","author":"吕陶","text":"橙色似黄金，佳名最为贵。\n一腹饱秋霜，尝之有馀味。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43632,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"北园","author":"吕陶","text":"可爱北园景，春来游者多。\n欲知民乐否，处处是笙歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43633,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用与可韵为湖亭杂兴十首 其一","author":"吕陶","text":"流水两三条合，翠筠千万枝垂。\n漫说忘情待物，亦尝对景题诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43634,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用与可韵为湖亭杂兴十首 其二","author":"吕陶","text":"簿领绝无留事，亲朋少有来书。\n度日此中閒坐，自惭也是官居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43635,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用与可韵为湖亭杂兴十首 其三","author":"吕陶","text":"湖上澄波似鉴，林间曲径如村。\n双鸟飞来碧照，独蝉吟彻黄昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43636,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用与可韵为湖亭杂兴十首 其四","author":"吕陶","text":"楼外四垂晴霭，帘前一饷清风。\n更倚危栏北望，岷山半出云中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43637,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用与可韵为湖亭杂兴十首 其五","author":"吕陶","text":"治郡乃称太守，退公自是閒人。\n已向环中得趣，何须事外劳神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43638,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用与可韵为湖亭杂兴十首 其六","author":"吕陶","text":"弱柳低低舞岸，新蒲拂拂笼沙。\n贪向水边倾耳，不知纱帽攲斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43639,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用与可韵为湖亭杂兴十首 其七","author":"吕陶","text":"朴学粗知义命，幽怀聊寄风骚。\n道胜何如时与，位卑安用言高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43640,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用与可韵为湖亭杂兴十首 其八","author":"吕陶","text":"有著在人为累，无营与物何功。\n祇此也该至理，懒能更说真空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43641,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用与可韵为湖亭杂兴十首 其九","author":"吕陶","text":"小器祇堪近用，要途莫笑閒官。\n到了野情易足，自于拙分常安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43642,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用与可韵为湖亭杂兴十首 其十","author":"吕陶","text":"花烂适逢佳节，酒醲宜赏青春。\n酩酊任他醉客，芳菲付与游人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43643,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事五首 其一","author":"吕陶","text":"斜日半山隐隐，暮云千里濛濛。\n北望黄昏微月，西来顷刻清风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43644,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事五首 其二","author":"吕陶","text":"闭门可以罗雀，垂钓何必求鱼。\n有耳倦闻俗事，无心更读閒书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43645,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事五首 其三","author":"吕陶","text":"乐俗亭下流水，嘉会宫前茂林。\n双瞳日日凝睇，远梦时时访寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43646,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事五首 其四","author":"吕陶","text":"林下木奴渐熟，樽前欢伯差浓。\n万事都来身外，一毫不置胸中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43647,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事五首 其五","author":"吕陶","text":"岣嵝数峰秀胜，潇湘万顷清深。\n云雨有时变化，风涛莫测浮沈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43648,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读韩长孺传","author":"吕陶","text":"梁孝事平终结爱，王恢谋沮已和亲。\n早知蹇甚难为相，何必赉金与贵人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43649,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读朱浮传","author":"吕陶","text":"权归刺举已条陈，慱士非才贵得真。\n若也国恩殊不卖，单辞未必死功臣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43650,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"裴矩","author":"吕陶","text":"西巡北幸四夷朝，权宠功名尽易邀。\n惟有高丽犹旅拒，灵旗从此便征辽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43651,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宇文士及","author":"吕陶","text":"象床金埒极豪华，出入隋唐似一家。\n自古圣君须远佞，禁中佳木不须誇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43652,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李大亮","author":"吕陶","text":"游田未见说虞箴，佞语贪谋竞奉承。\n岂独怀中有佳鹞，更教大亮献名鹰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43653,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王求礼","author":"吕陶","text":"秋晚梨花忽盛开，满朝称贺不称灾。\n景佺求礼真奇论，冬月如何有瑞雷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43654,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元德秀二首 其一","author":"吕陶","text":"五凤楼前观大酺，肯因工拙见贤愚。\n优倡数百被锦绣，安得人歌于蔿于。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43655,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元德秀二首 其二","author":"吕陶","text":"嗜酒弹琴徒自知，累囚尸虎县前归。\n世人名利心不尽，那得再逢元紫芝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43656,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王武俊","author":"吕陶","text":"巨盗盘根岁月深，交流战血竞浮沈。\n一言便解苍生祸，何事君恩薄贾林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43657,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阳城","author":"吕陶","text":"终日衔杯酒是家，十年全不话忠邪。\n一朝便伏延英阁，馀力犹能坏白麻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43658,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张万福","author":"吕陶","text":"闻说宣麻伏紫宸，愿将忠胆触龙鳞。\n此翁八十真堪笑，何事昌言有直臣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43659,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钱徽","author":"吕陶","text":"封疆万里等閒开，一日千金不吝财。\n持语无名求贡者，何须更入右银台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43660,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舒元舆","author":"吕陶","text":"仗内邪根欲去难，承平思虑渐阑珊。\n殿帘高捲春风里，空忆词臣赋牡丹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43661,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李甘","author":"吕陶","text":"夜进麻词晓未宣，满朝簪笏尽谊然。\n李甘轻肆君休议，不相奸凶已可贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43662,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柳仲郢","author":"吕陶","text":"方当炙手已寒灰，倚伏循环可动怀。\n试问华堂歌舞妓，几人曾以玉为钗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43663,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李景让","author":"吕陶","text":"终日清风耸搢绅，不存骗石远他人。\n如何议欲迁三庙，却使门庭有俗尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43664,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王潮","author":"吕陶","text":"六幕恢恢皆纲罗，琴书无计避干戈。\n泉南更起招贤院，从此衣冠去转多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43665,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为山","author":"吕陶","text":"累石封泥一饷间，层岩叠嶂尽回环。\n真形惟有山常在，何事徒劳作假山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43666,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"植竹","author":"吕陶","text":"为怜高节耸寒林，择地培根我意深。\n千亩封侯虽未必，且凭霜雪试虚心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43667,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"种花","author":"吕陶","text":"春到穷山生意回，试凭山土育根荄。\n花开莫笑无名器，纵得名花未易栽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43668,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"树萱","author":"吕陶","text":"北堂风物不惊秋，儿女攀怜欲解愁。\n未悟诗人深切意，世间何草可忘忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43669,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"栽菊","author":"吕陶","text":"花名药品两相兼，种菊虽多岂避嫌。\n而我折腰求五斗，赏心于尔愧陶潜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43670,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伐树","author":"吕陶","text":"此心非是好伤生，重倚西轩觉眼明。\n但得樗樠芽蘖尽，县人何必笑丁丁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43671,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]